      {
        "id": "gold-01",
        "stepLabel": "01 GOLD",
        "layout": "stamped",
        "title": "God is perfect",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Just as artists express themselves through their talents, God takes pleasure in His creation."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "The Bible reveals that God created everything for Himself, choosing humanity to express His love."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "He created us not out of narcissism, but for an intimate relationship that blesses us beyond our imagination."
          }
        ],
        "media": ["/images/gospel/gold-perfect.jpg"],
        "buttons": [
          { "type": "next", "label": "Continue", "nodeId": "gold-01-next" }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "gold-02",
        "stepLabel": "01 GOLD — Holiness",
        "layout": "stamped",
        "title": "God cannot dwell with sin",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Although God is perfect and reveals Himself through His creation, He cannot dwell with sin, and no sin is allowed in heaven."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Although He created mankind in His image and loves us more than anything else He made, He demands our obedience."
          }
        ],
        "media": ["/images/gospel/gold-holy.jpg"],
        "buttons": [
          { "type": "next", "label": "Continue", "nodeId": "gold-02-next" }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "gold-scripture-1",
        "stepLabel": "01 GOLD — Scripture",
        "layout": "stamped",
        "title": "God is love",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "And we have known and believed the love that God has for us. God is love, and he who abides in love abides in God, and God in him. [1 John 4:16]"
          }
        ],
        "media": ["/images/gospel/scripture-love.jpg"],
        "buttons": [
          { "type": "next", "label": "Continue", "nodeId": "gold-scripture-1-next" }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "gold-scripture-2",
        "stepLabel": "01 GOLD — Scripture",
        "layout": "stamped",
        "title": "Created for His pleasure",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Thou art worthy, O Lord, to receive glory and honour and power: for thou hast created all things, and for thy pleasure they are and were created. [Revelation 4:11]"
          }
        ],
        "media": ["/images/gospel/scripture-creation.jpg"],
        "buttons": [
          { "type": "next", "label": "Continue", "nodeId": "gold-scripture-2-next" }
        ],
        "modes": ["long"]
      },
  
  
      {
        "id": "dark-01",
        "stepLabel": "02 DARK",
        "layout": "stamped",
        "title": "We are sinners",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Humanity is inherently sinful, and our actions oppose God's nature."
          },
          {
            "type": "checklist",
            "items": [
              "Hatred",
              "Lust",
              "Anger",
              "Selfishness",
              "Rebellion"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "These separate us from God and hinder our fellowship with Him."
          }
        ],
        "media": ["/images/gospel/dark-sin.jpg"],
        "buttons": [
          { "type": "next", "label": "Continue", "nodeId": "dark-01-next" }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "dark-02",
        "stepLabel": "02 DARK — Law",
        "layout": "stamped",
        "title": "Why the law matters",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "God gave us His law to help us understand right from wrong and to convict us of our sins and our need for forgiveness."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "All have sinned and fall short of the glory of God."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "To be in His presence, we must be perfect as He is. God cannot overlook sin; His justice demands accountability."
          }
        ],
        "media": ["/images/gospel/dark-law.jpg"],
        "buttons": [
          { "type": "next", "label": "Continue", "nodeId": "dark-02-next" }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "dark-scripture",
        "stepLabel": "02 DARK — Scripture",
        "layout": "stamped",
        "title": "The whole world guilty before God",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Now we know that whatever the law says, it says to those who are under the law, that every mouth may be stopped, and all the world may become guilty before God. [Romans 3:19]"
          }
        ],
        "media": ["/images/gospel/scripture-guilty.jpg"],
        "buttons": [
          { "type": "next", "label": "Continue", "nodeId": "dark-scripture-next" }
        ]
      },
  
  
      {
        "id": "red-01",
        "stepLabel": "03 RED",
        "layout": "stamped",
        "title": "Saved by Jesus",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Before creation, God had a plan to save us."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "He sent His Son, Jesus, to become a man and live a sinless life."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "He did not die for His sins. He took on ours."
          }
        ],
        "media": ["/images/gospel/red-cross.jpg"],
        "buttons": [
          { "type": "next", "label": "Continue", "nodeId": "red-01-next" }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "red-02",
        "stepLabel": "03 RED — Finished",
        "layout": "stamped",
        "title": "It is finished",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Jesus endured the wrath of God, died, and was forsaken by the Father."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "God raised Him from the dead, and now through faith we can be forgiven because Jesus paid our debts."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Before His last breath on the cross, Jesus declared, “It is finished.”"
          }
        ],
        "media": ["/images/gospel/red-finished.jpg"],
        "buttons": [
          { "type": "next", "label": "Continue", "nodeId": "red-02-next" }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "red-scripture",
        "stepLabel": "03 RED — Scripture",
        "layout": "stamped",
        "title": "What is the gospel?",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "That Christ died for our sins according to the Scriptures, and that He was buried, and that He rose again the third day according to the Scriptures. [1 Corinthians 15:3-4]"
          }
        ],
        "media": ["/images/gospel/scripture-gospel.jpg"],
        "buttons": [
          { "type": "next", "label": "Continue", "nodeId": "red-scripture-next" }
        ]
      },
  
  
      {
        "id": "light-01",
        "stepLabel": "04 LIGHT",
        "layout": "stamped",
        "title": "Only Jesus is good enough",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "We often deceive ourselves into thinking we are good enough for heaven, but that isn't true."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Only Jesus is good enough to reach heaven."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Salvation is a free gift that cannot be earned."
          }
        ],
        "media": ["/images/gospel/light-righteousness.jpg"],
        "buttons": [
          { "type": "next", "label": "Continue", "nodeId": "light-01-next" }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "light-02",
        "stepLabel": "04 LIGHT — Faith",
        "layout": "stamped",
        "title": "His righteousness credited to us",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "If we believe in His Son and accept salvation through Jesus' sacrifice and resurrection, we will be regarded as His children, with His righteousness credited to us by faith."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Though we don't deserve heaven, we can enter because Jesus forgives and cleanses us from our unrighteousness when we trust in Him."
          }
        ],
        "media": ["/images/gospel/light-faith.jpg"],
        "buttons": [
          { "type": "next", "label": "Continue", "nodeId": "light-02-next" }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "light-scripture",
        "stepLabel": "04 LIGHT — Scripture",
        "layout": "stamped",
        "title": "No other name",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Nor is there salvation in any other, for there is no other name under heaven given among men by which we must be saved. [Acts 4:12]"
          }
        ],
        "media": ["/images/gospel/scripture-name.jpg"],
        "buttons": [
          { "type": "next", "label": "Continue", "nodeId": "light-scripture-next" }
        ]
      },
  
  
      {
        "id": "green-01",
        "stepLabel": "05 GREEN",
        "layout": "stamped",
        "title": "Grow in Jesus",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Those who are saved will be transformed by God's power, and the evidence of salvation is a changed life."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "If anyone is in Christ, he is a new creation."
          }
        ],
        "media": ["/images/gospel/green-growth.jpg"],
        "buttons": [
          { "type": "next", "label": "Continue", "nodeId": "green-01-next" }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "green-02",
        "stepLabel": "05 GREEN — Fruit",
        "layout": "stamped",
        "title": "Saved to do good works",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Believing in Jesus is just the beginning of the Christian life."
          },
          {
            "type": "checklist",
            "items": [
              "Honor His Word",
              "Live according to His will",
              "Love others",
              "Share the good news"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "We are not saved by good works, but we are saved to do the good works God has prepared for us."
          }
        ],
        "media": ["/images/gospel/green-fruit.jpg"],
        "buttons": [
          { "type": "next", "label": "Continue", "nodeId": "green-02-next" }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "green-scripture",
        "stepLabel": "05 GREEN — Scripture",
        "layout": "stamped",
        "title": "Pruned to bear more fruit",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Every branch in Me that does not bear fruit He takes away; and every branch that bears fruit He prunes, that it may bear more fruit. [John 15:2]"
          }
        ],
        "media": ["/images/gospel/scripture-fruit.jpg"],
        "buttons": [
          { "type": "next", "label": "Continue", "nodeId": "green-scripture-next" }
        ],
        "modes": ["long"]
      },
  
  
